    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "00fd0f68_b393f11f",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/BuiltInCodeSnippetID.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 64,
      "author": {
        "id": 5230
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T17:32:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "wdyt about bumping SerializationUtils.cpp::kCurrent_Version to 2, adding a kPrevious_Version (of 1), and allowing both versions to be parsed in stream_is_pipeline?\n\nOld keys that run afoul of this renumbering will be rejected as ill formed but this would, at least, give us some signal re what is going on and, potentially, allow us to remap old keys or reject them out of hand.\n\nWe could also add a check to Android\u0027s precompile so, if all the keys were out of date, we would fallback to prewarming and PaintOption-based precompile.",
      "revId": "f21e05f70bae4604bac76350539cf196259eadcd",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e6acaeb8_0d7fb591",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/BuiltInCodeSnippetID.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 64,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T20:48:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right now won\u0027t the files be deleted on any OS update? So we technically don\u0027t need to worry about backwards compatibility?\n\nIt\u0027s simple enough to bump the key version for such a large change, it\u0027s more whether or not we find the effort worthwhile for parsing old keys and updating them. Are you imagining a world where if we later bump from version 2 -\u003e 3, we can delete all the 1 -\u003e 2 migration code and replace it with whatever logic is needed for 2-\u003e3?  We could have a unit test that embeds a serialized key we exported from a paint option using v1 code, then deserialize it and make sure it covers the paint keys that we get from the paint options processed using v2 code.",
      "parentUuid": "00fd0f68_b393f11f",
      "revId": "f21e05f70bae4604bac76350539cf196259eadcd",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
